      "text": "Cuchara imbuida de energía telequinética que potencia\nlos movimientos de tipo Psíquico. Debe llevarla un\nPokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Strumento da dare a un Pokémon.\nCucchiaio dotato di potere telecinetico che\npotenzia le mosse di tipo Psico.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "An item to be held by a Pokémon. This spoon is\nimbued with telekinetic power and boosts\nPsychic-type moves.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "念力を　こめた　スプーン。\n持たせると　エスパータイプの\n技の　威力が　あがる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "注入了念力的汤匙。\n携带后，超能力属性的\n招式威力就会提高。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
